FORK NOTICE

This tree is a fork of pxpipe, not an official release from Steven or
teamchong.

- Upstream: https://github.com/teamchong/pxpipe
- Imported tag: v0.16.0 (commit 9e0e0e99b4483f40e8a58036bb1f6a1a81c331e3)
- Upstream author: Steven (https://github.com/teamchong)
- The MIT license and copyright notice above are the upstream license and
  are kept intact.

Additional changes in this fork (hybrid PAKT pipeline, ChatGPT Codex
prompt_cache_breakpoint fix, MCP server) are copyright (c) 2026 Srinivas
Pendela.

This fork also ships a dependency on PAKT (Pipe-Aligned Kompact Text),
package @sriinnu/pakt, MIT license, copyright Srinivas Pendela.

- PAKT: https://github.com/sriinnu/clipforge-PAKT
- Author: Srinivas Pendela (https://github.com/sriinnu)

PAKT's L1 syntax is inspired by TOON Format (https://github.com/toon-format/spec)
by Nicholas Charlton (https://github.com/nichochar), as credited by the PAKT
project.
